    <p>Project Mercury is a first person shooter created in Unreal Engine 5.3. The game was created by a team of 11 people, with the audio team consisting of 3 people. The audio team was responsible for creating and implementing all audio in the game, including sound effects and music. The audio was created in Ableton and implemented in Unreal Engine using systems like sound cues, blueprints, metasounds, attenuation, and more. The audio team worked closely with the rest of the development team to ensure that the audio enhanced the player experience and fit the overall aesthetic of the game.</p>

